You focus the inexorable pull of nature against a single creature, eroding it and allowing it to be reclaimed by the cycle of life.

This deals [99, 133, 159, 182, 202 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Nature and [99, 133, 159, 182, 202 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Acid damage to the target, and is particularly devastating against undead and constructs, dealing 25% more damage to them.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
